  │    12   ## 4. Key Vocabulary                                                                                                                                            │
  │    13                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    14   | Word / Phrase | Meaning | Example Sentence |                                                                                                                  │
  │    15   |---|---|---|                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    16 - | reconstruction | 重建、復原 | The city used its reconstruction fund to rebuild after the earthquake. |                                                        │
  │    17 - | fund | 基金、專款 | The government set up a fund to help small businesses recover. |                                                                          │
  │    18 - | rebuild | 重建、改建 | They plan to rebuild the old district next year. |                                                                                     │
  │    16 + | unfreeze (funds) | 解凍（資金）— 恢復被凍結資金的可動用狀態 | The bank agreed to unfreeze the funds after the investigation. |                                [38;2;108;112;134m│
  │    17 + | frozen funds | 凍結的資金 — 暫時無法動用的款項 | Over $2 million in frozen funds were released last week. |                                                   │
  │    18 + | release (funds) | 釋放／撥付（資金）— 較口語的「解凍」替代說法 | The court ordered the bank to release the funds to the owner. |                              │
  │    19 + | thaw | 解凍（本意為冰雪融化，引申為關係或資金鬆動） | After months of tension, there was a thaw in diplomatic relations. |                                    │[39m
  │    20 + | lift the freeze on | 解除對…的凍結 — 正式／法律語境常用 | The government lifted the freeze on the company's accounts. |                                       │
  │    21                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    22   ## 5. Useful Sentence Pattern                                                                                                                                   │
  │    23                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    24   **Pattern:**                                                                                                                                                    │
  │    23 - a ___ fund (一筆用於 ___ 的基金)                                                                                                                                │
  │    25 + We need to ___ the funds so that ___.                                                                                                                           │
  │    26                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    27   **Example:**                                                                                                                                                    │
  │    26 - a disaster relief fund (災難救助基金)                                                                                                                           │
  │    28 + We need to unfreeze the funds so that the project can continue.                                                                                                 │
  │    29                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    30   ## 6. Speaking Version                                                                                                                                          │
  │    31                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    30 - money set aside for rebuilding                                                                                                                                  │
  │    32 + We've got to get those funds unfrozen so we can keep things moving.                                                                                             │
  │    33                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    34   ## 7. Common Mistake                                                                                                                                            │
  [38;2;108;112;134m│    35                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    34 - Don't say: "rebuild fund"                                                                                                                                       │
  │    35 - Say: "reconstruction fund" or "rebuilding fund"                                                                                                                 │
  │    36 - (「重建」當形容詞修飾 fund 時，用名詞 reconstruction 或動名詞 rebuilding，不用動詞原形 rebuild。)                                                               │
  │    36 + Don't say: "defrost the funds." — *defrost* is only for food/appliances (e.g. defrost the chicken).                                                             │
  │    37 + Say: "unfreeze the funds" or "release the funds."                                                                                                               │
  │    38                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    39 + Don't say: "unfrozen the funds" when describing the current state.                                                                                              │
